@page "/about"
@layout Layout.PublicLayout

<PageTitle>About - 2d6 Dungeon App</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <img src="images/logo-with-name-transparent.png" alt="2d6 Dungeon App" class="about-logo" />

    <FluentCard class="about-card">
        <h2>What is this?</h2>
        <p>
            <a href="https://drgames.co.uk/2d6-dungeon-a-classic-dungeon-crawler-solo-player-game/" target="_blank">2D6 Dungeon</a>
            is a classic dungeon crawler, print and play, roll and write game designed for solo play, created by DR Games.
            You explore randomly generated dungeon rooms, fight monsters and collect treasure as you strive to become a legendary adventurer.
        </p>
        <p>
            The 2d6 Dungeon App is a digital companion to the game, built with the creator's approval.
            It helps you build your adventurer, rolls the dice, draws the map, guides you through the rules and keeps your character sheet.
            It is open source and still a work in progress.
        </p>
    </FluentCard>

    <FluentCard class="about-card">
        <h2>Beta demo</h2>
        <p>
            This hosted version is a beta demo. Access is by invitation only, and saved adventurers and adventures
            may be reset from time to time. Want to try it? Reach out and ask for an invite.
        </p>
    </FluentCard>

    <FluentCard class="about-card">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>Questions, ideas, feedback, collaborations or sponsorship: I'd love to hear from you.</p>
        <ul class="about-links">
            <li>
                <a href="https://discord.gg/6zA3jKw" target="_blank">Discord</a>
                &mdash; join the community to chat, ask questions and share ideas.
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://github.com/fboucher/2d6-dungeon-app" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
                &mdash; browse the code, <a href="https://github.com/fboucher/2d6-dungeon-app/issues" target="_blank">open an issue</a>
                or follow the <a href="https://github.com/users/FBoucher/projects/13" target="_blank">project board</a>.
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/fboucher" target="_blank">GitHub Sponsors</a>
                &mdash; support the project.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </FluentCard>
</div>
